invariant: INV-14
file: tls.c
catches: webpki_session_test
reason: a TRUST=webpki config with now_seconds 0, a clock the caller
  never set, passes ch_connect, and the handshake it starts fails later
  with CH_EAUTH at the certificate dates instead of CH_EINVAL at the
  config. bin/webpki_session_test's clock boundary rows object.

--- old
    return cfg->now_seconds != 0;
--- new
    (void)cfg;
    return 1;
